# Tribunal "The Museum": Torasa Aram, the Museum of Artifacts' curator, explains
# that the museum buys artifacts (10). Selling to her is open-ended; the case
# checks only the entry.
# Run: python -m tools.live.test_instance mwtest --cases <this folder> --fast --checkpoints --stop-on-fail --load mwtest_ms_estate_sale --timeout 2400
# See docs/commentary/headless_testing.md#quest-runs

case ms_museum
run
player->PositionCell 1 220 -110 0 "Mournhold, Museum of Artifacts"
until 600 "Torasa Aram"->GetDistance player < 400
talk Torasa Aram
ask Museum of Artifacts
expect GetJournalIndex MS_Museum == 10
bye
end
